WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.180
Thank you.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.540
You

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:52.140
song is one of those rare compositions that wins over all listeners with its lively swing.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.040
because of its own charm and natural appeal.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:57.950
It wasn't necessary for anybody to make it popular.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.890
But there's one man.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.120
who made it famous.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.640
Rudy Valley.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:03.700
Hi-ho, everybody.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.560
I know you all love the old Mainsteins.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.050
I wish you'd join us in singing it.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:11.190
Find it easy to keep in time.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.740
You'll sing with a little bouncing ball.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.920
Here we are. Get ready.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:17.210
Let's go.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.270
We'll be right back.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.600
You

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:06.760
To the gods, to the fates, to the rulers of men and their destinies, to the lips, to the eyes, to the girls who will love us someday.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:25.410
Oh, Phil Stein, to dear old Maine, shut the raptors in, drink a toast, once again, let every loyal Maine man stand, drink the happy heart.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.280
I'm on my mind.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.620
College of our hearts always.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:43.830
I'm severe old.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.900
Thanks to the careless day.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.070
It's all.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.310
To the light that is moving in.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:00.250
Huh?
